WEBVTT

00:00:29.320 --> 00:00:32.115
(yelping)

00:00:34.617 --> 00:00:35.952
(straining)

00:00:37.954 --> 00:00:38.955
(screaming)

00:00:45.295 --> 00:00:47.005
NEIL deBUCK WEASEL: The universe...

00:00:47.088 --> 00:00:50.842
A vast expanse of space and matter.

00:00:50.925 --> 00:00:54.971
It includes all that we see,
and all that we know.

00:00:55.638 --> 00:00:57.557
Since the beginning of time,

00:00:57.640 --> 00:01:00.393
we have wondered how it came to be.

00:01:00.477 --> 00:01:03.063
A gloriously orchestrated plan?

00:01:03.146 --> 00:01:05.732
A chance series of events?

00:01:05.815 --> 00:01:10.361
Or something much, much dumber?

00:01:10.445 --> 00:01:11.446
(yelping)

00:01:16.993 --> 00:01:18.661
(humming)

00:01:19.788 --> 00:01:20.789
(sniffing)

00:01:23.666 --> 00:01:24.667
Aha!

00:01:27.504 --> 00:01:29.255
(grunting)

00:01:29.339 --> 00:01:30.340
(screaming)

00:01:31.841 --> 00:01:32.842
(groans)

00:01:33.968 --> 00:01:35.178
(sniffs) Eee!

00:01:37.222 --> 00:01:38.223
(sniffing)

00:01:39.015 --> 00:01:40.016
(metallic clanging)

00:01:43.144 --> 00:01:44.145
(sniffing)

00:01:45.688 --> 00:01:47.023
-(clangs)
-(reverberating)

00:01:48.024 --> 00:01:50.026
(groaning)

00:01:51.319 --> 00:01:52.278
(sniffing)

00:01:52.362 --> 00:01:53.363
(exclaims)

00:01:54.572 --> 00:01:55.907
(powering up)

00:02:06.793 --> 00:02:07.794
(gasps)

00:02:23.101 --> 00:02:24.102
(straining)

00:02:26.354 --> 00:02:27.355
(groans)

00:02:28.773 --> 00:02:29.774
(straining)

00:02:37.532 --> 00:02:38.950
(screaming)

00:02:40.743 --> 00:02:41.744
(groans)

00:02:46.749 --> 00:02:47.709
(screams)

00:02:47.792 --> 00:02:48.793
(alarm blaring)

00:02:50.420 --> 00:02:51.421
(screams)

00:02:55.592 --> 00:02:56.593
(groans)

00:02:58.052 --> 00:02:59.053
(gasps)

00:03:00.471 --> 00:03:01.472
(screams)

00:03:03.641 --> 00:03:05.727
(yelping)

00:03:18.615 --> 00:03:19.616
(screaming)

00:03:24.287 --> 00:03:25.496
(echoing scream)

00:03:25.580 --> 00:03:26.581
(straining)

00:03:28.082 --> 00:03:30.126
(groaning)

00:03:31.586 --> 00:03:32.629
(whimpers)

00:03:42.180 --> 00:03:43.765
(gasps)

00:03:47.435 --> 00:03:49.187
(screaming)

00:03:54.442 --> 00:03:55.568
(gasps)

00:03:59.656 --> 00:04:01.866
(screaming)

00:04:03.284 --> 00:04:04.535
(grunting)

00:04:12.085 --> 00:04:13.086
(straining)

00:04:17.966 --> 00:04:18.967
(screaming)

00:04:21.094 --> 00:04:22.095
(groans)

00:04:27.183 --> 00:04:28.226
(gasps)

00:04:28.935 --> 00:04:29.936
(cooing)

00:04:32.313 --> 00:04:34.857
(Also Sprach Zarathustra playing)

00:04:43.408 --> 00:04:44.409
(grunting)

00:04:46.786 --> 00:04:47.787
(screams)

00:04:55.628 --> 00:04:56.629
(gasps)

00:05:10.101 --> 00:05:11.394
(chuckles nervously)

